.TH CBINDGEN 1 "September 2026" "cbindgen" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cbindgen \- generate C, C++, or Cython bindings for a Rust library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cbindgen
.RI [ options ] " [crate-directory|source-file]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cbindgen
reads a Rust crate or source file and emits declarations for its public C ABI.
A crate input normally names the directory containing Cargo.toml.
Configuration is read from cbindgen.toml unless another path is supplied.
Generated declarations do not change the ABI or ownership rules of the Rust code.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config " PATH"
Read configuration from PATH.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-lang " LANGUAGE"
Select c, c++, or cython output.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " PATH"
Write bindings to PATH instead of standard output.
.TP
.B \-\-verify
Compare generated bindings with the file named by \-\-output and fail if different.
.TP
.B \-\-crate CRATE_NAME
Select a crate when the input is a Cargo project or workspace.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-parse-dependencies
Parse dependency crates as well as the selected crate.
.TP
.B \-\-only-target-dependencies
Fetch dependencies only for the target platform. TARGET overrides the host target.
.TP
.B \-\-lockfile PATH
Use this Cargo.lock file, useful for workspace builds.
.TP
.B \-\-metadata PATH
Reuse JSON from cargo metadata rather than invoking Cargo for dependency metadata.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-style " STYLE"
Select both, tag, or type declarations.
.TP
.B \-\-cpp-compat
Add C++ compatibility declarations to generated C bindings.
.TP
.B \-\-package-version
Include the package version in the generated header comment.
.TP
.B \-\-clean
Expand macros using a fresh temporary directory.
.TP
.B \-\-profile PROFILE
Use debug or release when expanding macros.
.TP
.B \-\-depfile PATH
Write traversed source-file dependencies. Requires \-\-output.
.TP
.B \-\-symfile PATH
Write a list of symbols suitable for linker integration.
.TP
.B \-v
Increase logging verbosity; repeat for additional detail.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Report errors only.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display command help.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Display the generator version.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
cbindgen --lang c --output include/library.h .
cbindgen --lang c++ --output include/library.hpp .
cbindgen --verify --output include/library.h .
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates success. Generation errors and differing bindings in verification
mode return a nonzero status.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I cbindgen.toml
Generator configuration; options cover parsing, naming and output layout.
.SH NOTES
Cargo metadata and macro expansion can require dependencies. Reproducible offline
builds should vendor dependencies and use a controlled Cargo configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cargo (1),
.BR rustc (1)
